  "_id": "index-carry",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Lehi1 is carried away in vision, 1 Ne. 1:8 (14:30). the Twelve are carried away in the Spirit, 1 Ne. 11:29. daughters of the Lord’s people shall be carried upon Gentiles’ shoulders, 1 Ne. 21:22 (22:6, 8; 2 Ne. 6:6; Isa. 49:22). when man speaks by the Holy Ghost, power of the Holy Ghost carries it unto men’s hearts, 2 Ne. 33:1. words of Christ shall carry us beyond vale of sorrow, Alma 37:45. people delivered up for long time to be carried about by temptations of devil, 3 Ne. 6:17.",
